        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 15. Prior to filling a vacancy from a Civil Service list, temporary employees and PRN Nurses have the right to bid and be selected for vacancies within the seniority unit as follows, provided they are reachable on the appropriate Civil Service list:",
